---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms of Service | AcousticSearch"
  description="Terms of Service for AcousticSearch IEM Recommendation Engine."
>
  <div className="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 relative z-10 text-textPrimary">
    <a href="/" className="font-mono text-xs text-textMuted hover:text-accentPrimary uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 inline-block">
      &larr; Back to Search
    </a>
    
    <h1 className="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
      Terms of Service
    </h1>
    
    <p className="font-mono text-xs text-textMuted uppercase mb-8">
      Last Updated: August 11, 2026
    </p>

    <div className="space-y-6 font-body text-textMuted leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using AcousticSearch, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use the application.
      </p>

      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">2. Use of Service</h2>
      <p>
        AcousticSearch is provided free of charge for informational and educational sound preference recommendations. You agree not to misuse the API through automated rate abuse, scraping, or malicious traffic.
      </p>

      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">3. Audio Data & Measurement Attribution</h2>
      <p>
        Frequency response data is derived from open-source measurements provided by AutoEq (MIT Licensed, © Jaakko Pasanen) and community contributors including oratory1990. Recommendations are mathematically calculated approximations and should be used alongside personal listening.
      </p>

      <h2 className="font-display text-xl font-bold text-textPrimary">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The service is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind. AcousticSearch is not affiliated with any headphone manufacturer or retailer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
